# EtClubTierBadge Component

## Purpose & Scope

`EtClubTierBadge` is a presentational medal icon: two overlapping coins with a
per-tier metallic gradient, used to visualize a member's eToro Club tier.

It is intentionally **dumb / props-driven**:

- It renders a `tier` you pass in — it does NOT know about the BFF, player
  levels, or business mapping. Resolving `playerLevelId → ClubTier` is the
  caller's responsibility (e.g. `getClubTier` in the app layer).
- Colors are brand-fixed gradients per tier, not theme tokens — the medal looks
  the same in light and dark mode.

If you need the small "Club" text pill (membership/gating marker), use
`EtClubBadge` instead — that is a different component.

## Entry Point & Contract

```tsx
import { EtClubTierBadge } from 'etoro-ui';

<EtClubTierBadge
  tier="diamond"   // 'bronze' | 'silver' | 'gold' | 'platinum' | 'diamond' | 'etorian'
  size={44}        // px, default 30; artwork scales from a 30×30 viewBox
  testID="club-badge"
/>
```

| Prop     | Type       | Default | Notes                                                      |
| -------- | ---------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `tier`   | `ClubTier` | —       | Selects the gradient (and sparkle overlay for `diamond`)  |
| `size`   | `number`   | `30`    | Width/height in px                                        |
| `testID` | `string`   | —       | Forwarded to the outer wrapper `<View>`                   |

## Tiers

| Tier       | Gradient (from → to) | Notes                              |
| ---------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| `bronze`   | `#FFD6C0 → #B97652`  | Metallic, from Figma export        |
| `silver`   | `#E3E7F0 → #939BAF`  | Metallic, from Figma export        |
| `gold`     | `#FFDA8A → #AF6C26`  | Metallic, from Figma export        |
| `platinum` | `#DCEAFF → #6E86C0`  | Cool blue-silver                   |
| `diamond`  | `#FFFFFF → #DCE6F2`  | Near-white + animated sparkles     |
| `etorian`  | `#6EFF8B → #0EB12E`  | eToro brand green (base club tier) |

## Animation (diamond only)

The `diamond` tier overlays three sparkles that fade + scale in/out on an
infinite loop, staggered (1 → 3 → 2) so they twinkle out of phase. Built on
`react-native-reanimated`. Other tiers render no animation.

## Anti-patterns

- ❌ Passing a `playerLevelId` number — map it to a `ClubTier` first.
- ❌ Overriding the gradient via `style` — tier colors are part of the brand.

## Dependencies

- `react-native-svg` — coins (`Circle` + `LinearGradient`) and sparkle path
- `react-native-reanimated` — diamond sparkle loop
